# Toolchain and lockfile (Azure alignment)

The authoritative rules live in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) → "Node and npm toolchain (match Azure
Pipelines)". They are not duplicated here — follow that section for Node/npm versions, `npm ci` vs
`npm install`, lockfile guards (`optionalDependencies`, `overrides.preact`, `legacy-peer-deps`),
and `check-toolchain`.

Before merging dependency changes, run the `dependency-update-check` skill in
`.devin/skills/` to confirm the pipeline is green.
